:"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"辨正论·卷第四","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"资治通鉴考异·卷六","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"北齐兰陵王高肃墓及碑文述略","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"中原文物","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"高肃及其","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"文物春秋","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"龙门石窟与洛阳佛教文化","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"八琼室金石补正续编·卷八","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"}],"wikisourceLinks":[],"retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:34:05.318Z","attribution":{"source":"Chinese Wikipedia contributors","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0; bibliography metadata only","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","status":"candidate index, not independently verified evidence"}}],"sourceIds":["source:beiqishu","source:zhoushu","source:beishi"],"reviewIds":[],"claimIds":[],"matches":[{"documentId":"document:beiqishu-f5fbfc6c280be5fb","query":"高長恭","count":1,"offset":5083,"excerpt":"陽士深在軍　諸本「定」下有「州」字，北史無。按定州屬北齊，這時並未發生什麼變化，高長恭是北齊王子，怎會去攻討。上文已云長恭和段韶攻定陽，這裏正指此事。後人以「陽士深」連讀，妄增「州」字，今據北史刪。〕\n〔又聞周軍已入雀鼠谷　三朝本、南本、北本、殿","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:zhoushu-1fc6d1d1f0811c8c","query":"高長恭","count":1,"offset":1371,"excerpt":"襄。齊人嬰城固守。憲使柱國、譚公會築石殿城，以為汾州之援。齊平原王段孝先、蘭陵王高長恭引兵大至，憲命將士陣而待之。大將軍韓歡為齊人所乘，遂以奔退，憲身自督戰，齊眾稍卻。會日暮，乃各收軍。\n\n及晉公護誅，高祖召憲入，憲免冠拜謝。帝謂之曰：「天下者，","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:beishi-c739ba486daae717","query":"高長恭","count":1,"offset":1351,"excerpt":"入兩乳谷，襲克齊伯杜城。使柱國譚公會築石殿城以為汾州之援。齊平原王段孝先、蘭陵王高長恭引兵大至，大將軍韓歡為齊人所乘，遂退。憲身自督戰，齊眾稍卻。會日暮，乃各收軍。\n\n及晉公護誅，武帝召憲入，免冠拜謝。帝謂曰：「汝親則同氣，休戚共之，事不相涉，何","matchType":"name-occurrence"}],"matchCount":3,"gaps":["身份連結尚未完成編輯核對；同名、異名或同時代關係可能有誤配。","原人物分析及能力數值尚未逐句核對。","來源中的年代、關係與評價仍需逐條轉成有出處的主張。"],"notes":["姓名／重新導向命中，人物身份與每條書目尚須逐項核對。","姓名、分類、時代及稱號保留原庫資料，不自動視為史實。"],"version":"b66c5a60a41e2334","matchedDocuments":[{"id":"document:beiqishu-f5fbfc6c280be5fb","bookId":"book:beiqishu","requestedTitle":"北齊書/卷11","title":"北齊書/卷11","sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E5%8C%97%E9%BD%8A%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B711","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2546237","historyUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E5%8C%97%E9%BD%8A%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B711?action=history","revisionId":2546237,"revisionTimestamp":"2025-04-04T15:23:38Z","retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:47:02.089Z","sha256":"cbbc4417ce80457ec9b374c9f2531688dd0bae7ccda65aca7778478d1be761de","textSha256":"54b046e8114ad851ff099c8825d899c9bc35153397579c75220148ad0564716c","expandedWikitextSha256":"cbbc4417ce80457ec9b374c9f2531688dd0bae7ccda65aca7778478d1be761de","characters":5585,"contentPath":"/static/data/history/archive-books/beiqishu.json","status":"downloaded","acquisitionStatus":"downloaded","reuse":"Ancient underlying text; Wikisource transcription attribution and CC BY-SA 4.0 for applicable contributions","extraction":"wikitext-conservative-v2.1.0","normalizedAt":"2026-10-02T11:14:37.338Z","upstreamTextQuality":25,"upstreamTextQualityMeaning":"Wikisource platform quality marker; not a percentage of text transcribed","textCompleteness":"not-independently-collated","extractionNotes":["Textquality 25% 是維基文庫平台品質標記，不代表正文已轉錄比例。"],"expandedTransclusionTitles":[],"transclusionIssues":[],"transclusions":[],"textPath":"/static/data/history/web/releases/b66c5a60a41e2334/documents/ff58aaf31c5e7d5da01d.json","wikitextPath":"/static/data/history/web/releases/b66c5a60a41e2334/wikitext/ff58aaf31c5e7d5da01d.json","relatedDocumentIds":[]},{"id":"document:zhoushu-1fc6d1d1f0811c8c","bookId":"book:zhoushu","requestedTitle":"周書/卷12","title":"周書/卷